Package: novaos-archive-keyring
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: NovaOS Project <novaos@localhost>
Depends: apt
Description: NovaOS update channel (signing key and package source)
 Lets apt and Nova Updates receive the NovaOS packages (Nova apps, desktop
 and system settings) from the NovaOS update channel on GitHub. The packages
 there are signed with the NovaOS archive key, which this package installs to
 /usr/share/keyrings/novaos-archive-keyring.gpg (used only for this source).
